ll Assessment Scale\n\n5 = Consider for Award: I think this paper could be considered for an outstanding paper award at an *ACL conference (up to top 2.5% papers).\n\n4 = Strong: This study provides sufficient support for all of its claims. Some extra experiments could be nice, but not essential.\n\n3 = Acceptable: This study provides sufficient support for its main claims. Some minor points may need extra support or details.\n\n2 = Resubmit next cycle: I think this paper needs substantial revisions that can be completed by the next ARR cycle.\n\n1.5 = Resubmit after next cycle: I think this paper needs substantial revisions that cannot be completed by the next ARR cycle.\n\n1 = Do not resubmit: This paper has to be fully redone, or it is not relevant to the *ACL community (e.g. it is in no way related to computational processing of language).\n\nThe Overall assessment score is an explicit recommendation for the outcome of this paper, if it were committed to an *ACL venue. This is a composite score reflecting your assessment of soundness, excitement, and also other factors like novelty and impact."],"durationSeconds":15.513530868000002}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NwC7evY1hXBa5wCoXSnnLg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the EMNLP/ARR review guidelines. Let me summarize:\n\n**ARR Review Form (2025+, used for EMNLP 2026):**\n- Three scores: Soundness, Excitement, Overall Assessment\n- Overall Assessment scale: 1-5 (1=Do not resubmit, 1.5=Resubmit after next cycle, 2=Resubmit next cycle, 3=Acceptable, 4=Strong, 5=Consider for Award)\n- EMNLP acceptance rate is typically ~22-25%\n\n\nNow I'm setting up two parallel reviewers—one focused on methods and experiments, the other on novelty and related work—and I need to prepare their prompts carefully with the paper content, review context, and the ARR scoring framework while ensuring they review blindly.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1758,"cache_read_input_tokens":69813,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1758},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57df35a8-7776-42f2-9a89-3def6408fbf8","uuid":"ddd4820a-0b57-41a1-b25f-610e2c80de68"}
