{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YC8L9YoNgTWUEgW6ZTZsFE","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_2/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 2\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS — 递归生成深度可从统计特征高精度区分，进入 research phase\\\\n  rationale: Pythia-1.4B 4-depth pipeline 验证核心假设：4-class acc 78.2% (>>40% threshold),\\\\n    d1v2 AUC 0.861 (>>0.6 threshold)。控制实验排除域混淆（过滤代码后 acc 提升至 81.6%）。Top 特征为 surprisal\\\\n    variance 和 perplexity percentiles，说明信号来自分布窄化而非内容差异。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pipeline_pythia_002\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 4-class acc 78.2%, d1v2 AUC 0.861, content-type control 81.6%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 517, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XDVVU6DE7mVdLyxj1wMeL4","session_id":"57df35a8-7776-42f2-9a89-3def6408fbf8","uuid":"9af6f946-afbd-45ae-8702-20834c4f2098","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:42:53.175Z"}
